    "title": "Special Besan Sev | बेसन सेव | Traditional Indian Besan Sev",
    "body_html": "<p><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">Savor the </span><strong style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\" data-end=\"500\" data-start=\"450\">crispy, flavorful delight of Special Besan Sev</strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">, a traditional<strong> I</strong></span><strong style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\" data-end=\"542\" data-start=\"516\">ndian namkeen snack</strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"> handcrafted by </span><strong style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\" data-end=\"578\" data-start=\"558\">Bhagvat Prasadam</strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\">. Made from </span><strong style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\" data-end=\"628\" data-start=\"590\">premium quality besan (gram flour)</strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"> and seasoned with authentic spices, this </span><strong style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\" data-end=\"689\" data-start=\"670\">mixture namkeen</strong><span style=\"font-size: 0.875rem;\"> delivers a perfect crunch and rich taste in every bite.</span></p>\n<p data-end=\"985\" data-start=\"749\">Ideal for <strong data-end=\"843\" data-start=\"759\">prasad offerings, tea-time snacking, festive Diwali treats, or corporate gifting</strong>, our <strong data-end=\"870\" data-start=\"849\">Special Besan Sev</strong> combines <strong data-end=\"934\" data-start=\"880\">freshness, tradition, and authentic Indian flavors</strong>, making it a must-have snack for every occasion.</p>",
